each range, point values of `lgamma` at `A`, `B`, and the end away from the pole confine
`|lgamma x| ≤ (1 + 2 ^ -40) afh` to `[A, B]` (`GammaRoot.root_domain_dec`, `root_domain_inc`).  A
Taylor model at 150 bits about the stored zero `-x0` bounds the polynomial absolutely within
`2 ^ -120` where `|lgamma| ≤ 2 ^ -24`, and models at 120 bits bound it within `2 ^ -63` relative on
the pieces on both sides (`GammaRoot.rootOk`).
-/

